      "anchor": {
        "section": "Candidate reusable premises"
      },
      "note": "Historical availability exclusion for firearms and gunpowder-in-battle in Novgorod/Rus in 1200–1300: gunpowder weapons are not used in European warfare in the 13th c., and pishchali appear in Rus only from the late 14th c.; no current weapon or stock in a 1230 scene.",
      "review_status": "approved"
    },
    {
